Date: Mon, 2 Feb 2026 10:05:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 03/11] Add discount rules and tax regions

Percentage and fixed-amount discounts run in priority order on what
earlier discounts left. Non-stackable discounts compete against the
stacked combination and the bigger saving wins. Tax regions support
reduced and exempt categories, tax-inclusive pricing and per-line or
per-order rounding.
